{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_120_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "545785736cd45bf190f190088b7324ac856d8dfc2f79cc70e550673849278a24", "ja": "ニャハッ☆　元気いっぱいだね！　よしよし。\n元気がなくなったら、茜ちゃんに会いに来るんだぞ～！", "zh": "喵哈☆真是活力满满呢！乖乖。\n要是没精神了，就来找小茜哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_120_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "9a89ef7fe6c82f88ca909d99760ddbc69c7343fa0c3a5a363984c1fbc3fb87d6", "ja": "そうそう、この曲、テーマパークのCMソングにも\nなってるから！　そっちもチェックよろしくね～！", "zh": "对了对了，这首歌还被用作主题乐园的广告歌！也请记得去关注一下哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
