{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_120_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "f0b1c13b1f7efea86e1525278aae176b3d6f98d5721c6ab02d5f220016c59779", "ja": "茜ちんのライブは、元気になれるよね～。\n真美も今夜、徹夜とかいけちゃうかも！", "zh": "茜的演唱会，真的让人好有活力呢～。真美感觉今晚就算熬夜也没问题了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_120_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "7ed14d1a2a84fa6b8ec98d3dc574ba524e1a67dde2ceadf0243a0263f3dc7f06", "ja": "う、うん、ありがとう！　でもそれどころじゃなくて！\nいたんだよ、今、例のネコちゃんが！　客席に！", "zh": "嗯、嗯，谢谢！不过现在不是说这个的时候啦！\n刚才看到了，那只传说中的猫咪！就在观众席里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_120_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1e2f156b6d43d92615704e3f107c340c0e501eac8464de73729ead530e4f2449", "ja": "例のネコちゃんって……あ、テーマパークの？\nひなたちゃん、見た？", "zh": "你说的那只猫咪……啊，是主题乐园的那只？\n小日向，你看到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
