{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_120_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "280a401807c48ec902bcd255614352460e4fbb64d41a2372193872bfc7913ce8", "ja": "っ！？　ひ、ひええっ！\n{$P$}、後ろですぅ！", "zh": "啊！？呜、呜哇啊！\n{$P$}，在你后面呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
