{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_120_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "054ba2004a6a7da147cd8f84b2a34fecd265444042953520a2cc430b6ba93f0e", "ja": "って、茜ちゃん、近づいてきてるよ！？\nな、なんかちょっと不気味かも……。", "zh": "等等，小茜，它正在靠近哦！？\n总、总觉得有点吓人……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_120_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "f879e4c9e0351af1fbd773dde6b77170f05c826d84b29064b6babbc835ae31f5", "ja": "いや、大丈夫だよ翼ちゃん！\n茜ちゃんとネコちゃんは、もう友達だからね！", "zh": "没事的啦，翼！\n小茜和猫咪已经是朋友了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_120_1020_mascotneko", "source_sha256": "7617cefec4dacf523636c1ec377f29c92d5912baafc397984b06e42e4994da3c", "ja": "………………ぼそぼそ。", "zh": "………………小声嘀咕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_120_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "3ae02fcca004047dd88d6fe18766883cccd390e15ffcd7238e7de78a6b7a2acc", "ja": "ん？　何か言ってる……！？　なになに……。", "zh": "嗯？好像在说什么……！？让我听听看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_120_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "820ef12c2fafc7d56d190af04dc29739466271905b7db190dc0aa09ef931641e", "ja": "「この前はありがとう！　パレード、凄く楽しかった！\nどうしてもみんなに直接お礼が言いたくて」", "zh": "“上次谢谢你们！游行非常开心！\n我无论如何都想亲自向大家道谢”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_120_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "a7e6fb5ada0467aac33eb0edbba5a9f335500dc8c7811925d03da3ccad7b0f86", "ja": "へえ～、そうだったのかい？\nわざわざ、ありがとうねぇ。", "zh": "原来是这样呀～？\n还特意过来一趟，谢谢你啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_120_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "83b79e0043940ac48081c48907d194939358e2c272083d667abbee08ef77bfa0", "ja": "「特に、自分の事をマスコットとして大事にしてくれた\n茜ちゃんは、優しくて可愛くて最高のアイドルです！」", "zh": "「特别是把咱当成吉祥物悉心关照的\n小茜，既温柔又可爱，是最棒的偶像！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_120_1025_023aka", "source_sha256": "e6a87056d614aad68825ff6f49625a7da9d185d0cac4153ee541777de503b058", "ja": "「{$P$}ちゃんはもっとお給料を\nあげるべき！」だって！　うんうん、わかってるぅ。", "zh": "「应该给{$P$}多涨点\n工资！」它这么说了！嗯嗯，真是懂我呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_120_1026_p", "source_sha256": "0acc6eb0ccb918f0b5c0f638cb98e02aa06a3cd45551f2aeed399282c254f2db", "ja": "茜……本当にネコさんが言ってるのか？\nそれ……。", "zh": "茜……真的是猫咪在说吗？那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_120_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "bc518878960a9edb6a1ce1a28b687491bd6f0b106d2a2f60b7bcf87c58d44119", "ja": "も～、ホントだってば！　茜ちゃんを信じてよ！\n……ネコちゃん、ありがと♪　また遊びに行くからね！", "zh": "真是的～都说是真的啦！相信小茜嘛！\n……小猫咪，谢谢你♪我还会再来找你玩的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
